"Field Tasking Manager (Field-TM) na-enyere ndị otu aka itinye ihe ọmụma "
"mpaghara na njirimara maapụ site n'ịhazi ime maapụ n'ubi."

#: app/templates/landing.html:527
msgid ""
"Field-TM facilitates collaborative mapping by supporting and extending "
"mature tools\n"
"        like ODK and QField. It is a standalone mobile and web workflow "
"that helps teams collect\n"
"        geospatial data efficiently with commonly available Android "
"devices."
msgstr ""
"Field-TM na-eme ka ime maapụ ọnụ dị mfe site n'ịkwado ma gbasaa ngwaọrụ "
"siri ike dị ka ODK na QField. Ọ bụ usoro ọrụ ekwentị na weebụ nọọrọ onwe "
"ya nke na-enyere ndị otu aka ịnakọta data geospatial nke ọma site na "
"ngwaọrụ Android a na-ahụkarị."

#: app/templates/landing.html:534
